3. Binder IPC Mechanism
Binder is Android's primary IPC mechanism for cross-process communication.
Architecture:
┌─────────────────┐                    ┌─────────────────┐
│  Client Process │                    │  Server Process │
│                 │                    │                 │
│  ┌───────────┐  │                    │  ┌───────────┐  │
│  │   Proxy   │  │                    │  │   Stub    │  │
│  │ (BpBinder)│  │                    │  │(BnBinder) │  │
│  └─────┬─────┘  │                    │  └─────▲─────┘  │
└────────┼────────┘                    └────────┼────────┘
         │                                      │
         ▼                                      │
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    Binder Driver                        │
│                  (/dev/binder)                          │
│            (Kernel Space - Transaction)                 │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

Key Components:
// 1. Service Registration (Server Side)
class MyService : public BnMyService {
public:
    static void instantiate() {
        defaultServiceManager()->addService(
            String16("my_service"), 
            new MyService()
        );
    }
    
    // Implement service methods
    status_t doSomething() override {
        // Implementation
        return OK;
    }
};

// 2. Service Discovery (Client Side)
sp<IMyService> getService() {
    sp<IServiceManager> sm = defaultServiceManager();
    sp<IBinder> binder = sm->getService(String16("my_service"));
    return interface_cast<IMyService>(binder);
}

// 3. AIDL Interface Definition
// IMyService.aidl
interface IMyService {
    int getValue();
    void setValue(int value);
    oneway void asyncOperation();  // Non-blocking call
}

Binder Transaction Flow:
1. Client calls proxy method
2. Proxy serializes data into Parcel
3. transact() sends to Binder driver
4. Driver copies data to server address space
5. Server's onTransact() deserializes and executes
6. Reply sent back through same path

