Q: What is the difference between system_ext and product partitions?
A: - system_ext: Extensions to system (OEM customizations)
   - product: Product-specific apps/configs

Q: How does Android handle app crashes?
A: - Zygote forks app process
   - If crash, system_server detects via death recipient
   - Shows "App has stopped" dialog
   - App can be restarted

Q: What is the role of init.rc?
A: - First userspace process configuration
   - Starts all services (zygote, servicemanager, etc.)
   - Sets up file permissions, SELinux contexts
   - Property triggers

Q: How does a HAL communicate with kernel driver?
A: HAL → open(/dev/xxx) → ioctl() → Kernel driver → Hardware

