Key Data Types Summary
// DRIVER OUTPUT (Raw from hardware)
- Raw Bayer pixels (RGGB pattern)
- Brightness histogram (for AE)
- Focus score (for AF)
- Color channel sums (for AWB)
- Timestamps, frame numbers

// HAL OUTPUT (Processed for Android)
- YUV_420_888 (preview/video)
- JPEG (still capture)
- RAW16 (professional apps)
- Metadata (exposure, focus state, timestamp)

This is the essence of Camera HAL data processing - receive raw sensor data, process it, and deliver app-ready images with metadata!





